        "created_at": "2017-03-25T00:58:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a few bad runs against Omni 2. The worst was Legacy, Fanatic, KNYFE, Tempest, and Bunker. Everything was going well, but we were a little hurt. I finished off Omni 2 with KNYFE's Incidental Contact, but had accidentally healed Bunker to 11 with Cleansing Downpour. The worst is I could have hit Bunker first and gotten the unlock, I just wasn't paying attention.</p>",
