      {
        "id": 191864,
        "name": "NinjaMonkey",
        "username": "NinjaMonkey",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-27T11:40:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got it. Omni I was pretty easy with the team suggested above thanks to Parse denial card eliminating Fletchettes and 3 Critical Multiplers and that environment card that let’s you discard 7 plus cards to destroy it.</p>\n<p>Cosmitron though took 2 tries. Couldn’t get Parse’s denial card at all both times and Bunker got taken out by an ill timed Technological Singularity the first time through. Oh how I hate Omnitron.</p>",
