      {
        "id": 191867,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-30T00:30:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Using a strat from above(Bunker, TLTachy, Legacy, Wraith and Knyfe first; then swapped Knyfe out for O-X and had him at the head with Bunker last) I defeated both Omnis handily and got the unlock. I lucked out and got enough foam grenades and grapple hooks to keep the more dangerous enviro cards in line, and the damage boost from Legacy( with early draws of IP) made most everything else manageable. I also only ever got TS once a game, but since I kept my equipments slim I was able to get through it relatively unharmed for the most part. Did so well that I had to punch Bunker down to the appropriate health each time.</p><p>![](upload://6XMxxfeVH9VAMfMOEKqGvsfvlF2.jpeg)</p>",
