        "created_at": "2017-03-31T16:44:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"bobbertoriley\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/48/1910_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> bobbertoriley:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well, a Drone in Omnitron IV causing Cosmitron to play an EPE on the environment turn is definitely one way to NOT unlock this variant…:sigh:</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah I had that happen too… all my heroes went from near max HP to incapacitated in a single turn.</p>",
